	(footprint "frequencemetre:Arduino_Pro_Mini_Header_2x12"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "a61a35a3-efcf-4299-9f90-5b870a9ea197")
		(at 50 41 90)
		(descr "Arduino Pro Mini mounted on two 1x12 female header sockets (0.1in/2.54mm pitch, 0.6in/15.24mm row spacing). Only the two header courtyards are modelled - no full-board outline - so the volume under the plugged-in module is free for other components. Pad geometry and physical pin order verified against Alarm-Siren/arduino-kicad-library Arduino_Pro_Mini_Socket.kicad_mod (genuine SparkFun-style Pro Mini). Pad numbers 1-12 = left row top-to-bottom (TXO/D1, RXI/D0, RST, GND, D2..D9); pad numbers 13-24 = right row top-to-bottom (D10..D13, A0..A3, VCC, RST2, GND2, RAW) - matches symbol IC202:Arduino_Pro_Mini pins 1-24.")
